{
  "title": "向表单布局添加附加字段",
  "html": "<html><head></head><body><div>\n  <h1>向表单布局添加字段</h1>\n  <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" level=\"1\" mc=\"1\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n\t\t\t\t list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n    <p class=\"Numbered\" style=\"text-indent: -12px;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t margin-left: 12px;\">单击表单布局工具栏中的下拉菜单，以访问未使用属性的列表。</p>\n    <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n      <p class=\"Content_body_indented\"><img src=\"/aras-images/formprops.jpg\"></p>\n      <!--?rh-list_start level=\"1\" an=\"1\" class=\"rl-p-Figure_indented\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n\t\t\t\t list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n        \n        <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n          <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" mc=\"1\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; list-style: rh-list;\n\t\t\t\t list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n            <p class=\"Numbered\" style=\"text-indent: -12px;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t margin-left: 12px;\">选择要添加到表单布局中的属性。</p>\n            <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n              <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" level=\"1\" mc=\"1\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n\t\t\t\t list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n                <p class=\"Numbered\" style=\"text-indent: -12px;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t margin-left: 12px;\">在布局框架中单击并拖动属性到所需位置。</p>\n                <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n                  <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" level=\"1\" mc=\"1\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n\t\t\t\t list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n                    <p class=\"Numbered\" style=\"text-indent: -12px;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t margin-left: 12px;\">根据需要编辑字段属性。</p>\n                    <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n\n</div></body></html>",
  "sourceFile": "Adding_Additional_Fields_to_a_Form_Layout.htm"
}